<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en" class="scroll-smooth">
  <head>
    <%- include('partials/head', { pageTitle, metaDescription, canonicalUrl }) %>
  </head>
  <body id="top" class="min-h-screen bg-navy-800 text-slate-200 antialiased">
    <a href="#main-content" class="skip-link">Skip to main content</a>

    <%- include('partials/navbar') %>

    <main id="main-content" class="pt-24 sm:pt-28">
      <section class="border-b border-white/10 bg-navy-900">
        <div class="mx-auto max-w-container px-4 py-16 sm:px-6 sm:py-20 lg:px-8">
          <p class="eyebrow">Your privacy at Kali</p>
          <div class="mt-5 grid gap-8 lg:grid-cols-[minmax(0,1fr)_18rem] lg:items-end">
            <div>
              <h1 class="max-w-3xl font-display text-4xl font-bold leading-tight text-cream sm:text-5xl">
                A clear account of what happens to your information.
              </h1>
              <p class="mt-5 max-w-2xl text-base leading-relaxed text-slate-300">
                We use this site to help you find us and plan a visit. We do not run advertising pixels,
                analytics trackers or cross-site tracking cookies.
              </p>
            </div>
            <div class="border-l-2 border-gold-500 pl-5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-400">
              <p class="font-semibold text-cream">Policy details</p>
              <p class="mt-2">Kali Hotel &amp; Restaurant</p>
              <p>Janakpur Dham, Nepal</p>
              <p class="mt-2">Last updated: 24 October 2026</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <div class="mx-auto grid max-w-container gap-12 px-4 py-14 sm:px-6 lg:grid-cols-[15rem_minmax(0,1fr)] lg:gap-20 lg:px-8 lg:py-20">
        <aside class="h-fit rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-navy-900/60 p-5 lg:sticky lg:top-28" aria-label="On this page">
          <p class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-gold-400">On this page</p>
          <nav class="mt-4">
            <ul class="space-y-3 text-sm">
              <li><a class="footer-link" href="#information">Information we handle</a></li>
              <li><a class="footer-link" href="#site-tools">Cookies and site tools</a></li>
              <li><a class="footer-link" href="#sharing">Who receives information</a></li>
              <li><a class="footer-link" href="#retention">Storage and security</a></li>
              <li><a class="footer-link" href="#your-choices">Your choices</a></li>
              <li><a class="footer-link" href="#nepal-law">Nepal law</a></li>
              <li><a class="footer-link" href="#contact">Contact us</a></li>
            </ul>
          </nav>
        </aside>

        <article class="max-w-3xl space-y-12 text-sm leading-7 text-slate-300 sm:text-base">
          <section id="information" aria-labelledby="information-heading" class="scroll-mt-28">
            <p class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-gold-400">Information</p>
            <h2 id="information-heading" class="mt-2 text-2xl font-bold sm:text-3xl">What information we handle</h2>
            <p class="mt-4">
              You can browse the public pages without creating an account. If you send a reservation or event
              inquiry through our website service, we may handle your name, phone number, optional email address,
              requested date and time, party size, event type, occasion, message, and cabin or decoration
              preferences. Only include details needed to respond to your request.
            </p>
            <p class="mt-4">
              To protect the inquiry service from misuse, the server also records the request IP address and
              browser user-agent with a submitted inquiry. The service temporarily uses an IP address for
              rate-limiting. Our hosting provider may also keep routine server logs, subject to its own practices.
            </p>
            <p class="mt-4">
              If you contact us by phone, WhatsApp or Facebook instead, the details you choose to share are
              handled by that service as well as by us when we receive them.
            </p>
          </section>

          <section id="site-tools" aria-labelledby="site-tools-heading" class="scroll-mt-28 border-t border-white/10 pt-10">
            <p class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-gold-400">The website</p>
            <h2 id="site-tools-heading" class="mt-2 text-2xl font-bold sm:text-3xl">Cookies and site tools</h2>
            <p class="mt-4">
              This website does not set advertising or analytics cookies, use tracking pixels, or store information
              in browser local storage or session storage. We do not currently use an analytics or advertising
              tracking service.
            </p>
            <p class="mt-4">
              The site loads typefaces from Google Fonts. The Visit Us page embeds a Google Maps map; loading
              that page may allow Google to receive technical information such as your IP address and browser
              details. Google may use cookies or similar technologies under its own policies. You can avoid the
              embedded map by not scrolling to the Visit Us section on our home page; our address and contact
              details are also available in the site footer.
            </p>
            <p class="mt-4">
              Links to Google Maps, WhatsApp and Facebook take you to services operated by other companies.
              Following a link or sending a message is your choice. Those companies handle information under
              their own privacy terms; we do not control their practices.
            </p>
          </section>

          <section id="sharing" aria-labelledby="sharing-heading" class="scroll-mt-28 border-t border-white/10 pt-10">
            <p class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-gold-400">Access</p>
            <h2 id="sharing-heading" class="mt-2 text-2xl font-bold sm:text-3xl">Who receives information</h2>
            <p class="mt-4">
              We use inquiry details to respond to you and arrange the service you requested. We do not sell
              personal information. Information may be processed by the website host and the third-party
              services described above, or disclosed when required by applicable law or a lawful request.
            </p>
            <p class="mt-4">
              Google and Meta (which operates WhatsApp and Facebook) may process information outside Nepal.
              Please review their privacy information before using their embedded services or links.
            </p>
          </section>

          <section id="retention" aria-labelledby="retention-heading" class="scroll-mt-28 border-t border-white/10 pt-10">
            <p class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-gold-400">Care</p>
            <h2 id="retention-heading" class="mt-2 text-2xl font-bold sm:text-3xl">Storage and security</h2>
            <p class="mt-4">
              Website inquiry records are stored on the application server. They do not currently have an
              automated expiry; we retain them until they are no longer reasonably needed to respond, manage the
              requested booking or event, or meet applicable record-keeping obligations. We then delete them or
              take steps to remove identifying details, subject to lawful retention requirements and technical
              backup cycles.
            </p>
            <p class="mt-4">
              We use reasonable safeguards for the information handled by this site, but no internet transmission
              or storage system can be guaranteed completely secure. Please do not send payment-card details,
              passwords or other highly sensitive information through an inquiry.
            </p>
          </section>

          <section id="your-choices" aria-labelledby="your-choices-heading" class="scroll-mt-28 border-t border-white/10 pt-10">
            <p class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-gold-400">Your choices</p>
            <h2 id="your-choices-heading" class="mt-2 text-2xl font-bold sm:text-3xl">Access, correction and questions</h2>
            <p class="mt-4">
              You can ask us whether we hold information about you, request correction of inaccurate details, or
              ask us to delete information where applicable law permits. We may need to verify your identity
              before acting and may retain information we are legally required to keep.
            </p>
            <p class="mt-4">
              You can decline optional information, avoid third-party links and the embedded map, or use your
              browser settings to limit cookies from third-party services. Some external features may not work
              when blocked.
            </p>
          </section>

          <section id="nepal-law" aria-labelledby="nepal-law-heading" class="scroll-mt-28 border-t border-white/10 pt-10">
            <p class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-gold-400">Applicable framework</p>
            <h2 id="nepal-law-heading" class="mt-2 text-2xl font-bold sm:text-3xl">Nepal law</h2>
            <p class="mt-4">
              This notice is intended to explain our current website practices with reference to Nepal's
              Privacy Act, 2075 (2018), Privacy Rules, 2077 (2020), and Electronic
              Transactions Act, 2063 (2006), as applicable. It is not legal advice. The laws that apply depend
              on the circumstances, and this notice does not replace those laws.
            </p>
            <p class="mt-4">
              We may update this page if our website, services or legal obligations change. The date above shows
              when this notice was last revised.
            </p>
          </section>

          <section id="contact" aria-labelledby="contact-heading" class="scroll-mt-28 border-t border-white/10 pt-10">
            <p class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-gold-400">Get in touch</p>
            <h2 id="contact-heading" class="mt-2 text-2xl font-bold sm:text-3xl">Contact us about privacy</h2>
            <p class="mt-4">
              For a privacy question or request, contact Kali Hotel &amp; Restaurant, Ring Road, Janakpur Dham,
              Madhesh Province, Nepal.
            </p>
            <p class="mt-4">
              Phone: <a class="font-semibold text-gold-300 hover:text-gold-200" href="tel:<%= site.phoneE164 %>"><%= site.phone %></a><br />
              Email: <a class="font-semibold text-gold-300 hover:text-gold-200" href="mailto:<%= site.email %>"><%= site.email %></a>
            </p>
          </section>
        </article>
      </div>
    </main>

    <%- include('partials/footer') %>
    <script src="/js/main.js" defer></script>
  </body>
</html>
